OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-agency meeting over city's
OL,4,Aglassmaking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn upcoming multi-agency meeting could
OL,7,Fbe a "significant step forward" for a
OL,8,Fcity's glassmaking future, campaigners
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe event, which is expected to discuss
OL,12,Fhow to protect and develop the craft in
OL,13,FSunderland, comes as the National Glass
OL,14,FCentre (NGC) closed its doors in July.
OL,16,FA date for the meeting, which will be
OL,17,Forganised by North East Mayor Kim
OL,18,FMcGuinness, is yet to be confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
