OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-agency meeting over city's
OL,4,Aglassmaking
OL,5,
OL,6,FSave the National Glass Centre group is
OL,7,Fcalling for representatives of the city
OL,8,Fcouncil, Sunderland Culture, Arts
OL,9,FCouncil England, the University of
OL,10,FSunderland and the Department for
OL,11,FCulture, Media and Sport to attend.
